       'Draft the character arc alongside the plot: the lie the protagonist believes, the want versus the need, the moment of choice at the climax; make the external plot force the internal change.',
       'Break the beats into chapters and scenes: for each, the POV, the scene goal, the conflict, the outcome and what the reader learns; mark the sequel scenes (reaction, dilemma, decision) so the pacing breathes.',
       'Thread subplots and the antagonist\'s plan on separate lines and show where they cross the main plot.',
