       'Differentiate the voices: give each speaker a distinct vocabulary, sentence length and habit (interrupts, deflects, asks questions, speaks in absolutes) and apply it consistently.',
       'Fix the mechanics: said and asked as the default tags, action beats instead of adverbs, one speaker per paragraph, no tag where the beat already shows who speaks.',
